---
const destino='/w2/torneos';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Torneos | Pádel Las Flores</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow" />
    <meta name="description" content="Torneos ahora forma parte de la nueva experiencia deportiva." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="/w2/torneos" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/w2/torneos" />
    <script is:inline define:vars={{ destino }}>
      const url=new URL(destino,window.location.origin);
      url.search=window.location.search;
      url.hash=window.location.hash;
      window.location.replace(url.href);
    </script>
    <style>
      :root{color-scheme:dark;background:#080b0d;color:#f4f7f5;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
      *{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100dvh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0,rgba(215,25,45,.12),transparent 34%),#080b0d}
      main{width:min(620px,100%);padding:clamp(24px,6vw,48px);border:1px solid #30383d;border-top:3px solid #d7192d;border-radius:24px;background:#101519;box-shadow:0 28px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
      span{display:block;margin-bottom:12px;color:#ff7c89;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}h1{margin:0;font-size:clamp(2.25rem,7vw,4.5rem);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.04em}p{margin:20px 0;color:#aeb8b3;line-height:1.65}a{display:inline-flex;min-height:46px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 18px;border-radius:10px;background:#d7192d;color:white;font-weight:900;text-decoration:none}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #fff;outline-offset:4px}
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <span>Pádel Las Flores</span>
      <h1>Torneos ahora vive en W2.</h1>
      <p>Estamos trasladando la navegación al nuevo centro de competencias. Los enlaces y parámetros se conservarán automáticamente.</p>
      <a id="continuarTorneosW2" href="/w2/torneos">Continuar a Torneos W2</a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
